Anonymous NeurIPS 2026 Supplementary Material Notice

This package supports anonymous peer review of the accompanying paper. It
contains code, paper-facing result summaries, figures, tables, split/data
artifacts, and scripts for reproducing or auditing the reported experiments.

No full Llama base-model weights are redistributed in this package. External
datasets and model families are acknowledged in ASSET_LICENSES.md and remain
subject to their original licenses and access terms.
